sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant H as Web host
    participant R as Agent Runner
    participant P as PostgreSQL

    Note over B,H: Choose an inclusive date, e.g. 15 Dec 2026,<br/>or keep the chat long-term
    B->>H: POST /forge/v1/dispatch<br/>Forge-Destination: ide.chat.history.retention.set<br/>Chat ID, expected revision and policy
    H->>H: Check session, origin and CSRF
    H->>R: POST /v1/dispatch<br/>Bearer + same destination<br/>RetentionSetRequest
    alt Inclusive calendar date
        R->>R: Expire at start of the next day<br/>UTC unless a time zone is selected
    else long_term
        R->>R: Store no expiry time
    end
    R->>P: ChatHistoryDao write transaction<br/>Lock chat, check revision, update policy
    P-->>R: Committed policy and revision, or rejected write
    alt Commit succeeds
        R-->>H: chat_history_retention_set
        H-->>B: 200 · show saved policy
    else Missing chat or revision changed
        R-->>H: 404 · unavailable / 409 · conflict
        H-->>B: Refresh history before another edit
    end
